# DLA-4792-1: tzdata new timezone database (2026b → 2026c).
# This is a timezone data update, not a security vulnerability.
# gcr.io/distroless/static-debian12:nonroot does not yet ship the fixed
# package version (tzdata 2026c-0+deb12u1); no patched distroless image is
# available upstream (the Dockerfile's pinned digest is already the latest,
# checked 2026-10-05). Same entry as iam-org-membership. Remove this entry
# and bump the Dockerfile's runtime digest once distroless ships tzdata 2026c.
DLA-4792-1

# DLA-4845-1: ca-certificates 20250419~deb12u1 → deb12u2 (removes the
# distrusted Comodo "AAA Certificate Services" and "emSign ECC Root CA - G3"
# roots). gcr.io/distroless/static-debian12:nonroot does not yet ship the
# fixed package; the Dockerfile's pinned digest is already the latest
# upstream (checked 2026-10-21). The exposure itself is closed: the Dockerfile
# copies the builder's patched deb12u2 bundle over distroless's
# /etc/ssl/certs/ca-certificates.crt — Trivy still reports the finding only
# because it reads distroless's dpkg status metadata. The expiry forces a
# re-check: remove this entry, the Dockerfile's bundle COPY, and bump the
# runtime digest once distroless ships deb12u2.
DLA-4845-1 exp:2026-11-21

# DLA-4854-1: tzdata 2026b-0+deb12u1 → 2026e-0+deb12u1, a timezone-database
# refresh (Trivy: UNKNOWN; the CI gate fails on UNKNOWN). Same package and
# situation as DLA-4792-1 above.
# Not exploitable here: the service never loads a zone (no time.LoadLocation, no
# time/tzdata, no time.Local use; all timestamps are UTC).
# Blocked upstream: on 2026-10-26 the newest gcr.io/distroless/static-debian12
# :nonroot digest (sha256:afa5c872…) still ships tzdata 2026b. Remove this
# entry and re-pin once distroless ships tzdata >= 2026e.
DLA-4854-1 exp:2026-11-30

# DLA-4867-1: tzdata 2026b-0+deb12u1 → 2026f-0+deb12u1, the next timezone-
# database refresh after DLA-4854-1 (Trivy: UNKNOWN; the CI gate fails on
# UNKNOWN). Same package and situation as DLA-4854-1 above.
# Not exploitable here: the service never loads a zone (no time.LoadLocation, no
# time/tzdata, no time.Local use; all timestamps are UTC).
# Blocked upstream: on 2026-10-30 the newest gcr.io/distroless/static-debian12
# :nonroot digest (sha256:afa5c872…) still ships tzdata 2026b. Remove this
# entry (with DLA-4854-1) and re-pin once distroless ships tzdata >= 2026f.
DLA-4867-1 exp:2026-11-30
